        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"40ebec29-ebf0-4fb6-bb9a-235c91518589\",\"review_text\":\"Veri slow to load up and move thru.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7191261f-bfe9-49b2-a666-e1dc355db29c\",\"review_text\":\"Deleted Joe Rogan episodes.... Censorship baddddddd\"},{\"review_id\":\"6e427119-0ea7-4deb-af87-1797af98d07f\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify is the best everyone get premium it's worth it\"},{\"review_id\":\"225d887a-cea7-4bf4-a5cf-b52cb3970b7f\",\"review_text\":\"Lacking a family plan for premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9488c38-8e7f-4bfd-b96b-e5c4c068c94e\",\"review_text\":\"It is a wonderful experience bringing to life my youthful musical memories. Others music joined later and I really enjoyed every bit of it. The play back were awesome.\"},{\"review_id\":\"aaeefd61-d1fc-4578-badb-183f6a39480a\",\"review_text\":\"It plays and stops and plays again..Gosh!.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7e03c2c5-81f9-4c63-bbaa-155e16de8007\",\"review_text\":\"Its awsome, wonderful\"},{\"review_id\":\"9a236c19-d44d-47b6-918e-576ae9179ce9\",\"review_text\":\"Everything was great at the beginning, but then this morning, I tapped one of the songs in my liked songs category, and the app stopped working, saying I need to clear up my cache, so I did and nothing is still happening.\"},{\"review_id\":\"48716822-7b79-4599-8a61-b6613428a43c\",\"review_text\":\"Updates gets worse every single day.they evaen want premium for playing songs in que bruh f u\"},{\"review_id\":\"0d0577f6-be81-413b-863f-507bd7940f63\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely garbage plays stupid adds don't waste your mood on this garbage app\"}]}"
